@startuml
title CCL-01 - UML activity: typed graph validation
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
start
:Load definition and catalog;
:Index nodes and edges;
fork
  :Check unique IDs and one start/end;
fork again
  :Traverse reachability;
fork again
  :Check source/target port types;
fork again
  :Check bounded loops and side effects;
fork again
  :Check join cardinality and required evidence;
fork again
  :Estimate calls, tokens, runtime, and concurrency;
end fork
:Sort issues by stable code and location;
if (Any error?) then (yes)
  :Return invalid result;
  :Block publication / run creation;
else (no)
  :Return valid result with warnings;
  :Allow immutable publication;
endif
stop
@enduml
